    "head_commit": {
      "id": "63a3aa3e533ba466f02f1deabd36b9d3feb88985",
      "tree_id": "e593dc9bfe6ac2113d3fb23d21744fa670199774",
      "message": "feat(contracts): add experimental local identity revisions\n\nProblem\nLocal project mappings and contribution rationale changes need immutable, bounded records without granting workflow authority.\n\nDecision\nAdd experimental project descriptors, stable FileIds with explicit lineage operations, and content-addressed contribution revisions that bind exact source snapshots and optional brief objects.\n\nRationale\nThe contracts keep local ProjectKey storage separate from logical project identity, preserve uncertainty for inferred renames, and make brief-only changes produce a new revision.\n\nValidation\nRan rustfmt and git diff --check. Cargo and native tests were not run under the active runtime gate.",
      "timestamp": "2026-10-16T00:34:27Z",
      "author": {
        "name": "Christophe Henner",
        "email": "christophehenner@gmail.com"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "Christophe Henner",
        "email": "christophehenner@gmail.com"
      }
    },
