    "locked": false,
    "title": "feat(local): add experimental project identity and revisions",
    "user": {
      "login": "schiste",
      "id": 15890754,
      "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODkwNzU0",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15890754?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/schiste",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/schiste",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/schiste/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/schiste/following{/other_user}",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/schiste/gists{/gist_id}",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/schiste/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/schiste/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/schiste/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/schiste/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/schiste/events{/privacy}",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/schiste/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "user_view_type": "public",
      "site_admin": false
    },
    "body": "## Summary\nAdd experimental Local project descriptor, FileId lineage, and immutable contribution revision contracts.\n\n## Contract\nProject identity is distinct from the host-local collaboration key. Exact content and path bytes define enrollment; rename continuity requires explicit exact-content evidence; copies, splits, and new files receive proposal-scoped IDs; uncertain rename candidates remain explicit. A revision binds project, contribution, exact base/result snapshots, source changes, and optional exact brief object bytes. These records grant no workflow authority.\n\n## Test plan\nAdded a descriptor fixture independently recomputed with Python standard-library SHA-256/canonical JSON and contract tests for clone mapping, rename/copy/split, namespace conflicts, and rationale-only revision changes. Ran rustfmt and `git diff --check`; Cargo tests were not run under the current runtime gate.\n\n## Eval impact\nNo evaluation code or fixtures changed; no evaluations were run.\n",
